@traceForgeHost = http://localhost:5102

### 创建工单
POST {{traceForgeHost}}/api/work-orders
Content-Type: application/json

{ "orderNo": "MO-20260830-001", "productCode": "FG-2001", "batchNo": "BATCH-20260830-A", "plannedQuantity": 100, "plannedStart": "2026-08-30T08:00:00+08:00" }

### 工序报工
POST {{traceForgeHost}}/api/work-orders/MO-20260830-001/reports
Content-Type: application/json

{ "operationCode": "OP-10", "workstation": "LINE-01", "goodQuantity": 96, "defectQuantity": 4, "operator": "operator-01" }

### 质量检验
POST {{traceForgeHost}}/api/work-orders/MO-20260830-001/inspections
Content-Type: application/json

{ "checkpoint": "外观检验", "result": "Passed", "remark": "抽检 10 件，无划伤", "inspector": "qc-01" }

### 查询批次追溯
GET {{traceForgeHost}}/api/trace/BATCH-20260830-A
